(31,'257978369906409726','Investment Ideas By RMultiply - 16.12.2025',NULL,'<p><b><u></u></b></p><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><u><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgwI8isbvI9fSqOLkyqfk0uRBYV6rwA0VPF6IhvKfQZKuCZqCyWPJ-T5AEhroOBsogF1Hs6EqHD5cKypV_0_KL6cvRKAQbFbWH4pTMnp4oUxZO7wN3_nx2LAMmnrPOaNU8dSZgcBeBZ5E2R4FlhOekWWPbkrWWcBHCcXKNMZrw-9noM9_9T-SquUM6OpUg\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"91\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgwI8isbvI9fSqOLkyqfk0uRBYV6rwA0VPF6IhvKfQZKuCZqCyWPJ-T5AEhroOBsogF1Hs6EqHD5cKypV_0_KL6cvRKAQbFbWH4pTMnp4oUxZO7wN3_nx2LAMmnrPOaNU8dSZgcBeBZ5E2R4FlhOekWWPbkrWWcBHCcXKNMZrw-9noM9_9T-SquUM6OpUg\" width=\"320\" /></a></u></b></div><b><u><br /></u></b><b><u><span>RRkabel : </span></u></b><span>Buy at cmp\r\nwith sl 1400 target 1600…1700</span><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgWcgVQW0emsv_3eLjyKWu3W6dIGs6xZt2Q0Hw6GRcXXPq8gXhjh9bDgfM9gxYgp34fStL2uV9f4m8AEpFiaJu4kcBF7Pl67HZTWI9MB1sQ81vhHFES1VOvdlCk5eI4eGNxkHaN1lXO32jtFipenu-fAsap9cQKmRyp_Qmcocxd7cdTAwFws4wqAQTh2IQ\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"238\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgWcgVQW0emsv_3eLjyKWu3W6dIGs6xZt2Q0Hw6GRcXXPq8gXhjh9bDgfM9gxYgp34fStL2uV9f4m8AEpFiaJu4kcBF7Pl67HZTWI9MB1sQ81vhHFES1VOvdlCk5eI4eGNxkHaN1lXO32jtFipenu-fAsap9cQKmRyp_Qmcocxd7cdTAwFws4wqAQTh2IQ=w498-h238\" width=\"498\" /></a></div><br /><b><u><span>IDFC first bank : </span></u></b><span>Buy at cmp\r\nwith sl of 82 target 87…92..98</span><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiNbvv98HBfuL4MMZJuf-nf5kWmmkFmpfx2kJWwcNVnm1EvYaJ44szArlnwJJEoO2DjYTW5DIW6VLwOwyu0pNfX8XfTsCZXtBWnyNyfPC299Xwm18JVUe3MjbswcYZQIVxlcbO0RSMUQQhJg2L89LJEzxTCRO8TgcXpH8JM69d03iUAtVttBYtk51u6kMs\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"378\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiNbvv98HBfuL4MMZJuf-nf5kWmmkFmpfx2kJWwcNVnm1EvYaJ44szArlnwJJEoO2DjYTW5DIW6VLwOwyu0pNfX8XfTsCZXtBWnyNyfPC299Xwm