6600;\">(Neutral)</span></span></li></ul><ul><li style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"color:#006600;\">BofA on PVR: </span><span>Maintain\r\nUnderperform on Company, target price at Rs 945/Sh <span style=\"color:#006600;\">(Neutral)</span></span></li></ul><ul><li style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"color:#006600;\">GS on Lupin: </span><span>Maintain Neutral on\r\nCompany, raise target price at Rs 2025/Sh <span style=\"color:#006600;\">(Neutral)</span></span></li></ul><ul><li style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"color:#006600;\">UBS on PFC: </span><span>Maintain Buy on\r\nCompany, cut target price at Rs 580/Sh <span style=\"color:#006600;\">(Neutral)</span></span></li></ul><ul><li style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"color:#006600;\">Jefferies on Trump Tariffs:</span><span>\r\nRemain hopeful of an eventual trade deal with the US <span style=\"color:#006600;\">(Neutral)</span></span></li></ul><ul><li style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000;\">BofA on Trump Tariffs:</span><span> Still see downside\r\nrisks to both the current account, growth and potentially even inflation <span style=\"color:#FF0000;\">(Negative)</span></span></li></ul><ul><li style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000;\">Citi on Trump Tariffs:</span><span> It could impact\r\nboth current and capital account flows and put pressure on currency market <span style=\"color:#FF0000;\">(Negative)</span></span></li></ul><ul><li style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000;\">CLSA on BHEL:</span><span> Maintain\r\nUnderperform on Company, target price at Rs 198/Sh <span style=\"color:#FF0000;\">(Negative)</span></span></li></ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span>Warm\r\nRegards...</span></