;\">Investec on Torrent Pharma:</span><span>\r\nUpgrade to Buy on Company, raise target price at Rs 4100/Sh <span style=\"color:#006600;\">(Neutral)</span></span></li></ul><ul><li><span style=\"color:#006600;\">Macquarie on Nestle:</span><span> Maintain\r\nNeutral on Company, cut target price at Rs 2250/Sh <span style=\"color:#006600;\">(Neutral)</span></span></li></ul><ul><li><span style=\"color:#006600;\">Jefferies on SRF:</span><span> Maintain\r\nUnderperform on Company, raise target price at Rs 2640/Sh <span style=\"color:#006600;\">(Neutral)</span></span></li></ul><ul><li><span style=\"color:#006600;\">Jefferies on Supreme Ind:</span><span>\r\nMaintain Buy on Company, cut target price at Rs 5100/Sh <span style=\"color:#006600;\">(Neutral)</span></span></li></ul><ul><li><span style=\"color:#006600;\">Citi on ABAMC:</span><span> Maintain Sell on\r\nCompany, raise target price at Rs 820/Sh <span style=\"color:#006600;\">(Neutral)</span></span></li></ul><ul><li><span style=\"color:#006600;\">UBS on CG Power:</span><span> Maintain Buy on\r\nCompany, cut target price at Rs 890/Sh <span style=\"color:#006600;\">(Neutral)</span></span></li></ul><ul><li><span style=\"color:#006600;\">Jefferies on Bajaj Fin:</span><span> Maintain\r\nBuy on Company, raise target price at Rs 1100/Sh <span style=\"color:#006600;\">(Neutral)</span></span></li></ul><ul><li><span style=\"color:#006600;\">UBS on Bajaj Fin:</span><span> Maintain Sell on\r\nCompany, target price at Rs 750/Sh <span style=\"color:#006600;\">(Neutral)</span></span></li></ul><ul><li><span style=\"color:#006600;\">Macquarie on Bajaj Fin:</span><span> Maintain\r\nUnderperform on Company, target price at Rs 800/Sh <span style=\"color:#006600;\">(Neutral)</span></span></li></ul><ul><li><span style=\"color:#FF0000;\">Bernstein on Bajaj Fin: </span><span>Maintain\r\nUnderperform on Company, cut target price at Rs 640/Sh <span style=\"color:#FF0000;\">(Negative)</span></span></li></ul><ul><li><span style=\"color:#FF0000;\">