ain\r\nNeutral on Company, target price at Rs 1040/Sh<span style=\"color:#006600;\">\r\n(Neutral)</span></span></li><li style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000;\">Investec on Indigo: </span><span>Company must comply\r\nwith the new FDTL norms by 10 February 2026. Bad just goes worse, cut target\r\nprice at Rs 4040/Sh<span style=\"color:#FF0000;\"> (Negative)</span></span></li><li style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000;\">JM FIn on Indigo: </span><span>Passing turbulence\r\ncould lead to some lasting cost pressures<span style=\"color:#FF0000;\"> (Negative)</span></span></li></ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span>Warm\r\nRegards... </span></p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span>Nikhil Bhatt<br /></span><span>Business Editor<br /></span><span>Investment Point<br /></span><span>Contact :- XXXXX XXXXX<br /></span><span><a href=\"http://www.nikhilbhatt.in/\"><span>www.nikhilbhatt.in</span></a></span></div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span>Join Channel :- </span><span><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029Va6EjWxA2pL2q3fKm035\"><span>https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029Va6EjWxA2pL2q3fKm035</span></a></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in;text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000;\">The securities quoted are\r\nfor illustration only and are not recommendatory. Investment in securities\r\nmarket are subject to market risks. Read and agree Disclaimer and related all\r\nthe documents carefully before investing, mentioned on </span><span><a href=\"http://www.nikhilbhatt.in/\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;text-decoration:none;\">www.nikhilbhatt.in</span></a></span></p>','https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEg6CYtwv9uJYsupwBBcaXH5PyODuyu0vhuCXq9vUTXj5brHKimRcutFTR6467hYqA_GAF_Oqz9QKh3g5C57GNbJyWY1gWD3c3Ruv3rC2vwn0-eJcVWqSKotbBS